+## Description
 
-## Risk Assessment
+`blast-radius` builds a dependency graph for the service, counts the services
+that would be affected by a change to it, and assigns a risk level.
 
-Risk levels are calculated based on:
+With `--prometheus-url`, the graph is discovered from Prometheus. **Without it,
+the command runs against a built-in demo graph**, not your services — useful
+for trying the command out, meaningless for a real service.
 
-| Factor | Weight |
-|--------|--------|
-| Number of critical-tier dependents | 40% |
-| Total blast radius size | 30% |
-| Depth of dependency chain | 20% |
-| Cross-team impact | 10% |
+## Options
 
-### Risk Levels
+| Option | Required | Description |
+|--------|----------|-------------|
+| `--service SERVICE` | yes | Service name |
+| `--prometheus-url URL` | no | Prometheus server URL; omit to use the demo graph |
 
-| Level | Description |
-|-------|-------------|
-| `LOW` | < 3 total dependents, no critical tier |
-| `MEDIUM` | 3-10 dependents or 1 critical-tier service |
-| `HIGH` | > 10 dependents or multiple critical-tier services |
-| `CRITICAL` | Core infrastructure affecting > 50% of services |
+## Exit Codes
 
-## CI/CD Integration
